                                                "sense_id": "38992c08-3019-3c7c-8295-b76eb9d83469",
                                                "text": "A queenly creature with her quiet grace,\nAnd dazzling white hand veined cerulean:"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "62b17069-c5c1-49d3-82e9-c695c98b8a2a",
